WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(applause)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.590
- Speaking of the original
cast of "First Wives Club",

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.288
I hear you ran into Goldie
Hawn, which is awesome.

00:00:05.288 --> 00:00:06.121
- [Male Guest] What?

00:00:06.121 --> 00:00:08.360
- I would've just started saying
lines from "Bird on a Wire"

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.760
like all the films from my childhood.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.670
- She doesn't do well
with meeting icons though.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.503
- I don't either.

00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:13.482
I don't know if you've noticed.

00:00:13.482 --> 00:00:14.540
(laughing)

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.960
- Girl, it was a good thing
we weren't there together.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.610
First of all, it's
embarrassing because I was

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.250
at the psychic's.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.323
- You were at a psychic?

00:00:20.323 --> 00:00:21.760
- A psychic, not the side-kick.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.283
I was at the psychic.

00:00:24.286 --> 00:00:25.800
'Cause I was like just
tell me that everything

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.370
is gonna work out in my life, you know.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.817
And I guess Goldie wanted
to know if everything

00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:30.100
was gonna work out in her life.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.930
And it was right when
Kate had had the next,

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.860
her third baby, the little girl.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.830
And all I could think,

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.080
the door opened,

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.220
and there she was,

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.053
and I was like,

00:00:39.053 --> 00:00:41.142
I know my psychic isn't Goldie Hawn.

00:00:41.142 --> 00:00:42.027
You know what I mean?

00:00:42.027 --> 00:00:43.465
For a minute, I was like, maybe it is.

00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:45.045
- Wouldn't that be amazing?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.000
- I mean so amazing.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.625
Like that's where my
mind, our brain right?

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:48.530
- Exactly.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.490
- And then I just, I realized
she wasn't the psychic.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.323
And then I was like,

00:00:51.323 --> 00:00:55.560
oh my God, congratulations
on your baby girl!

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.393
(male laughing)

00:00:56.393 --> 00:00:57.226
- What did she do?

00:00:57.226 --> 00:00:58.059
- She did this.

00:00:58.059 --> 00:00:59.350
She was like, thank you.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.230
- That's kinda how I feel
Meryl got scared of me.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.180
I was loud, though.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.013
She should've been scared.

00:01:05.013 --> 00:01:05.903
I was excited.

